flowchart TB
  accTitle: Three journeys and role approval
  accDescr: An administrator grants mentor and institution roles. A member publishes a contribution and sources. A mentor checks a specific revision. An institution reads the claim, source and confirmation.
  A[Admin role approval] --> M[Approved mentor]
  A --> I[Approved institution]
  U[Member] --> C[Contribution and source links]
  C --> M
  M --> V[Confirmation of a specific revision]
  C --> I
  V --> I
  I --> Q[An informed conversation]
